# The repository stores text with LF, regardless of each machine's
# core.autocrlf setting — otherwise a checkout on Windows rewrites every line
# ending and a whole file shows up as changed without a single edit.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Detected as text on some machines, but a diff of it says nothing useful.
package-lock.json -diff

# Binary, never touch the bytes.
*.ico binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.woff2 binary
